{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a simple, clean and premium Shopify footer for KISS & KRY, a bamboo babywear brand.
    
    ### 1. Design
    - Full-width dark olive background: #383F2A.
    - Text colour: warm cream #F5F3E7.
    - Use Montserrat typography throughout.
    - Minimal, elegant and uncluttered layout.
    - Desktop padding: 40px 50px.
    - No gradients, shadows or decorative graphics.
    
    ### 2. Desktop Layout
    
    Create four simple columns:
    
    **Column 1 – Brand**
    - Heading: Kiss and Kry
    - Description: "Born from bamboo. Made for baby. Ultra-soft, naturally breathable essentials for every kiss and every cry."
    - Four small social icons: Instagram, Facebook, YouTube and Pinterest.
    
    **Column 2 – Shop**
    - Bodysuits
    - Footies
    - Rompers
    - Crib Sheets
    
    **Column 3 – Explore**
    - Why Bamboo
    - Our Story
    - Reviews
    - Care Guide
    - FAQ
    
    **Column 4 – Contact**
    - Chat on WhatsApp
    - Send us an email
    - @kissandkry
    
    ### 3. Typography
    - Brand heading: Montserrat Bold, 20px.
    - Column headings: Montserrat SemiBold, 11px, uppercase, mustard accent #DDAA32.
    - Navigation links: Montserrat Regular, 11px.
    - Description: Montserrat Regular, 11px.
    - Text colour: #C7C8B8.
    - Link hover colour: #FFFFFF.
    
    ### 4. Bottom Bar
    
    Add a thin horizontal divider.
    
    Below it, create a simple bottom row:
    
    Left:
    "© 2026 Kiss and Kry. All rights reserved."
    
    Centre:
    Small payment badges for UPI, VISA, Mastercard, RuPay and COD.
    
    Right:
    - Privacy Policy
    - Terms of Service
    - Refund Policy
    
    Use small 9px Montserrat text.
    
    ### 5. Responsive Design
    - Desktop: Four columns horizontally aligned.
    - Tablet: Two-column layout.
    - Mobile: Stack brand information, navigation and contact details vertically.
    - Centre the bottom copyright and legal links on mobile.
    - Prevent horizontal scrolling.
    
    ### 6. Shopify Functionality
    - Make all navigation links clickable.
    - Make social icons link to their respective profiles.
    - Make WhatsApp and email links functional.
    - Use Shopify's native policy URLs.
    - Make text, links, colours and social URLs editable through the Theme Editor.
    - Generate clean, self-contained Shopify Liquid code.
    - Ensure compatibility with Shopify 2.0.
    
    ### IMPORTANT
    Keep the footer SIMPLE. Do not add newsletter forms, extra sections, large icons, decorative illustrations, animations, extra columns or unnecessary elements. Prioritise clean spacing, readability and a premium olive-and-cream aesthetic., add this contact details as 
    ### Kiss & Kry – Complete Contact Details
    
    - Instagram: [@kissandkry](https://www.instagram.com/kissandkry/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)
    - Facebook: [Kiss & Kry Facebook Page](https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61563831763161\&utm_source=chatgpt.com)
    - WhatsApp: [+91 99997 38480](https://wa.me/919999738480?utm_source=chatgpt.com)
    - Phone: +91 99997 38480
    
    All four details can now be added to your Shopify footer as clickable links., remove payment icons and make the section more professional and at the place of brand name use the PNG icon for kiss and kry also change the background of this section as white or any light color used in site
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    padding: 40px 50px 18px;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.font.family }}, {{ block.settings.font.fallback_families }};
  }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width: 100%; max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__columns { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 44px; padding-bottom: 32px; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__brand-logo { display: block; max-width: {{ block.settings.logo_width }}px; height: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__brand-title { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description { max-width: 340px; margin: 0; color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { margin: 2px 0 16px; color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }}; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list { display: grid; gap: 11px; padding: 0; margin: 0; list-style: none; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} a { color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover { color: {{ block.settings.hover_color }}; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid currentColor; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__socials { display: flex; gap: 14px; margin-top: 18px; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__socials a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 20px; height: 20px; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__socials svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; fill: currentColor; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; border-top: 1px solid {{ block.settings.divider_color }}; padding-top: 16px; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copyright, .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__legal a { font-size: 10px; }
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__legal { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 18px; }
  @media screen and (max-width: 900px) { .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__columns { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 34px; } }
  @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
    .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding: 32px 22px 20px; }
    .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__columns { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; padding-bottom: 26px; }
    .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description { max-width: 100%; }
    .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 12px; }
    .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__legal { justify-content: center; gap: 12px; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<footer class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <div class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__columns">
      <div>
        {% if block.settings.brand_logo != blank %}
          <img class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__brand-logo" src="{{ block.settings.brand_logo | image_url: width: 600 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.brand_logo.alt | default: block.settings.brand_name | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ block.settings.brand_logo.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.brand_logo.height }}">
        {% else %}
          <h2 class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__brand-title">{{ block.settings.brand_name | escape }}</h2>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.description != blank %}<p class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description">{{ block.settings.description | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
        <nav class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__socials" aria-label="Social media">
          {% if block.settings.instagram_url != blank %}<a href="{{ block.settings.instagram_url }}" aria-label="Instagram"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm0 2a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v10a3 3 0 0 0 3 3h10a3 3 0 0 0 3-3V7a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H7zm5 3a5 5 0 1 1 0 10 5 5 0 0 1 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 0 0 6 3 3 0 0 0 0-6zm5.5-3a1.25 1.25 0 1 1 0 2.5 1.25 1.25 0 0 1 0-2.5z"/></svg></a>{% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.facebook_url != blank %}<a href="{{ block.settings.facebook_url }}" aria-label="Facebook"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.5 21v-8h2.7l.4-3h-3.1V8.1c0-.9.3-1.5 1.6-1.5h1.7V3.9c-.3 0-1.3-.1-2.5-.1-2.5 0-4.2 1.5-4.2 4.3V10H7.3v3h2.8v8h3.4z"/></svg></a>{% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.youtube_url != blank %}<a href="{{ block.settings.youtube_url }}" aria-label="YouTube"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M23.5 6.2a3 3 0 0 0-2.1-2.1C19.5 3.6 12 3.6 12 3.6s-7.5 0-9.4.5A3 3 0 0 0 .5 6.2 31 31 0 0 0 0 12a31 31 0 0 0 .5 5.8 3 3 0 0 0 2.1 2.1c1.9.5 9.4.5 9.4.5s7.5 0 9.4-.5a3 3 0 0 0 2.1-2.1A31 31 0 0 0 24 12a31 31 0 0 0-.5-5.8zM9.6 15.6V8.4l6.2 3.6-6.2 3.6z"/></svg></a>{% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.pinterest_url != blank %}<a href="{{ block.settings.pinterest_url }}" aria-label="Pinterest"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-3.6 19.3c0-.8 0-1.8.2-2.6l1.3-5.5s-.3-.6-.3-1.5c0-1.4.8-2.4 1.8-2.4.8 0 1.2.6 1.2 1.4 0 .9-.6 2.3-.9 3.6-.3 1.1.5 2 1.6 2 1.9 0 3.3-2.5 3.3-5.5 0-2.3-1.5-4-4.2-4-3.1 0-5 2.3-5 4.9 0 .9.3 1.8.8 2.3.2.3.3.4.2.7l-.3 1c-.1.3-.3.4-.6.3-1.4-.6-2-2.1-2-3.9 0-2.9 2.5-6.4 7.4-6.4 4 0 6.7 2.9 6.7 6.1 0 4.2-2.3 7.4-5.7 7.4-1.1 0-2.2-.6-2.6-1.3l-.7 2.7c-.2.8-.7 1.7-1 2.3A10 10 0 1 0 12 2z"/></svg></a>{% endif %}
        </nav>
      </div>
      <div><h3 class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.shop_heading | escape }}</h3><ul class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list">{% for i in (1..4) %}{% assign label_key = 'shop_label_' | append: i %}{% assign url_key = 'shop_url_' | append: i %}{% if block.settings[label_key] != blank %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings[url_key] | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{{ block.settings[label_key] | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></div>
      <div><h3 class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.explore_heading | escape }}</h3><ul class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list">{% for i in (1..5) %}{% assign label_key = 'explore_label_' | append: i %}{% assign url_key = 'explore_url_' | append: i %}{% if block.settings[label_key] != blank %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings[url_key] | default: routes.root_url }}">{{ block.settings[label_key] | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></div>
      <div><h3 class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.contact_heading | escape }}</h3><ul class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list">
        {% if block.settings.whatsapp_number != blank %}<li><a href="https://wa.me/{{ block.settings.whatsapp_number | remove: '+' | remove: ' ' | remove: '-' }}">{{ block.settings.whatsapp_label | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.email_address != blank %}<li><a href="mailto:{{ block.settings.email_address | escape }}">{{ block.settings.email_label | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.phone_number != blank %}<li><a href="tel:{{ block.settings.phone_number | remove: ' ' | remove: '-' }}">{{ block.settings.phone_number | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.instagram_handle != blank %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings.instagram_url }}">{{ block.settings.instagram_handle | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}
      </ul></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom"><div class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copyright">© {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} {{ block.settings.brand_name | escape }}. {{ block.settings.copyright_text | escape }}</div><nav class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__legal" aria-label="Policies">{% if shop.privacy_policy != blank %}<a href="{{ routes.privacy_policy_url }}">{{ block.settings.privacy_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}{% if shop.terms_of_service != blank %}<a href="{{ routes.terms_of_service_url }}">{{ block.settings.terms_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}{% if shop.refund_policy != blank %}<a href="{{ routes.refund_policy_url }}">{{ block.settings.refund_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}</nav></div>
  </div>
</footer>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Kiss and Kry footer",
  "settings": [
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"brand_logo","label":"Brand logo PNG"},
    {"type":"text","id":"brand_name","label":"Brand name","default":"Kiss and Kry"},
